    "text": "By kylelpj ,\n20 hours ago Ruston native Tambri Leedy was recently awarded a scholarship from the North Louisiana Medical Center Auxiliary. Leedy, a 2022 graduate of Ruston High School and current Louisiana Tech nursing student, received a check for $1,500 from the hospital’s auxiliary to aid her in her nursing degree. She was chosen... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
